English summary

Menalan Otzar is a free, unofficial Windows helper for the Otzar HaChochma desktop program. It provides a global-hotkey search box (default Alt+X, with Tab switching between lookup and book search), word-binding and prefix-letter options for book search, search history, automatic copying of selected text, and optional Microsoft Word buttons.

It works by sending simulated keyboard input to otzar.exe, so it cannot confirm whether an action succeeded. It is not affiliated with Otzar HaChochma and does not include the original software or its library.

Version 0.1.0 is an early release.
